// 003.13, 004.11, 018.2 (T43): `Confidential To auditor` marks an `Evidenced` fact for
// audience-scoped `ReasonGraph` redaction without altering `(lawful, valid)` verdicts.
Fact officer Identified by Off1.
Fact account Identified by Acc1.
Evidenced Fact kyc-dossier Identified by account
  Confidential To auditor, regulator.
Fact wire-released Identified by account.

Power release-wire Actor officer Related to account
  Holds when kyc-dossier(account)
  Valid when kyc-dossier(account)
  Creates wire-released(account).

SubmitEvidence kyc-dossier(Acc1) By "secret-escrow-bank-ref-991".

Scenario confidential-wire {
  ?Established(kyc-dossier(Acc1)).
  ?lawful release-wire(Off1, Acc1).
  ?valid release-wire(Off1, Acc1).
  release-wire(Off1, Acc1).
  ?wire-released(Acc1).
}
